{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:02 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:02 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:02 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33a1de5616b35affa880ed8892341ce1/2026-11/page_187.jpg\"/><p>尖沙咀發生嚴重車禍。今日（22日）下午2時28分，一輛私家車在寶勒巷6號對開失事，據報私家車撞及一輛輕型貨車，繼而剷上行人路撞倒多名途人，並撼向店舖門外才停下。救援人員趕到現場救援，事件中最少4人受傷，其中1人昏迷，被送往伊利沙伯醫院救治。</p><img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/25ead751d71ecab71c5d188003b3793a/2026-11/3_73.jpg\"/><img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a12f05fddd751020bf909a0dd2abe480/2026-11/4_5_61.jpg\"/><img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24cf4ef061d0a4fbcd7d7ea5ce37f896/2026-11/2_2_84.jpg\"/><img alt=\"fb馬路的事討論區圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3dd1981528f3650b8bc35c6c8655673d/2026-11/1_16_1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dc68f813244c86f0e7a636ad0b2340a7/2026-11/5_0_61.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4c8e3fe6915911e643ba2e40bc1542e0/2026-11/6_2_24.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:23:53.180485+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T07:02:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:25.007637+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:17:25.007637+00:00","content_hash":"ab0a9a31db9041eba8121c8ee8e682c97e4697f23dc7c0ebbce62450b987f04d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}